      "id": 7301800263872,
      "title": "Campsite Lentejas (Lentils)",
      "handle": "campsite-lentejas",
      "body_html": "<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Product Description</span></strong></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Our sopa de lentejas is a deliciously</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> hearty backpacking lentil soup made with a rich tomato and cilantro broth that rehydrates in minutes. <meta charset=\"utf-8\">Naturally high in plant-based protein, this comforting meal is perfect for backpacking trips, camp dinners, and outdoor adventures, packed with flavor for when you want something healthy, satisfying, and easy — because sometimes lazy lentejas just hit different after a long day outside.<br><br>Single Serving | Not Spicy | Vegan <meta charset=\"utf-8\">| 24g Protein | 490 Cal | 4.0 oz <br><br><br><i><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong>CALIFORNIA PROPOSITION 65 WARNING:</strong><span> Can expose you to arsenic, a carcinogen and reproductive toxicant. See www.p65warnings.ca.gov/food</span></i><br></span></p>\n<ul></ul>\n<ul></ul>",
