    {
      "id": 7301795578048,
      "title": "Charge-up Chilaquiles",
      "handle": "charge-up-chilaquiles",
      "body_html": "<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Product Description</span><span data-ccp-props='{\"201341983\":0,\"335559685\":0,\"335559738\":40,\"335559739\":0,\"335559740\":259}'> </span></strong></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>A flavorful backpacking breakfast inspired by traditional and classic Mexican green chilaquiles. Tortilla chips smothered in spicy tomatillo salsa and topped with beans, egg, and panela cheese creates a comforting and energizing camp meal any time of day.</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <span>Single Serving | Spice Level: Medium | Vegetarian | 490 Cal | 17g Protein | 3.5 oz</span><br><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <strong>CALIFORNIA PROPOSITION 65 WARNING:</strong><span> Can expose you to arsenic, a carcinogen and reproductive toxicant. See www.p65warnings.ca.gov/food</span><br></span></p>",
