      "title": "Aventura Arróz con Leche",
      "handle": "aventura-arroz-con-leche",
      "body_html": "<p><span><strong>Product Description</strong><br><br>Our trail-ready take on traditional arroz con leche. Made with coconut milk, strawberries, chia, and cinnamon, this lightweight backpacking dessert doubles as a delicious outdoor breakfast.</span></p>\n<p><span>Lightweight, packable, and easy to make — just add water and enjoy wherever the trail takes you.</span></p>\n<p>Single Serving | Vegan | 450 Cal | 7g Protein | 3.5 oz<br><br></p>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><strong>CALIFORNIA PROPOSITION 65 WARNING:</strong> Can expose you to arsenic, a carcinogen and reproductive toxicant. See www.p65warnings.ca.gov/food</p>",
